Anthropic golden files generated against expected Anthropic Messages API shape.

These inputs are NOT generated by running LiteLLM (see plan §14). Instead
they encode the documented Anthropic wire format from the official API docs:
https://docs.anthropic.com/en/api/messages

Divergences from LiteLLM's Python transforms are intentional where LiteLLM
is known to be buggy; the provider's official docs are authoritative.
